==English==
{{wikipedia|decipherment|lang=en}}

===Alternative forms===
* [[decypher]]

===Pronunciation===
* {{a|UK}} {{IPA|/dɪˈsaɪfə(ɹ)/|lang=en}}
* {{rhymes|aɪfə(r)|lang=en}}

===Verb===
{{en-verb}}

# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To [[decode]] or [[decrypt]] a [[code]] or [[cipher]] to plain [[text]].
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To [[read]] text that is almost [[illegible]] or [[obscure]].
# {{context|transitive|lang=en}} To find a [[solution]] to a [[problem]].

====Derived terms====
* [[decipherment]]

====Related terms====
* [[decrypt]]

